{% layout "base" %}
{% block content %}

<h1>You have been invited to Greenpill Network Steward Admin</h1>

<p>
  You have been invited to {{ projectName }}. This private Directus workspace is
  where Greenpill stewards review chapter information, suggest updates to public
  chapter profiles, and submit chapter initiatives for publisher review.
</p>

<p>Use this invite link to accept the invitation and set your password:</p>

{% render "button", text: "Accept invite and set password", href: url %}

<p>After you log in, open <strong>Content</strong> and start with:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Chapters</strong> to view the current public chapter profile.</li>
  <li><strong>Chapter Update Requests</strong> to suggest changes while the public page stays live.</li>
  <li><strong>Chapter Initiatives</strong> to add local programs, events, campaigns, and impact work.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  This invite is only for your assigned Greenpill steward content access. Please
  do not forward it. If the link expires or your chapter is missing after login,
  reply to the operator who invited you.
</p>

{% endblock %}
